# The world `wmc show`, `play` and `run` make when given no scenario.
# A scenario holds the physical world and where each kind starts; the rules
# hold everything else (docs/RULES.md, "Scenarios"). `[w h seed]` on the
# command line override `size` and `seed`.

seed 42
size 80 24
terrain water_scale 12 water_level 0.30 rock_on_soil 0.04 rock_on_water 0.01

# Each walkable cell draws a number in [0, 1); the shares cut that range in the
# order written, so reordering these lines moves who starts where.
start chicken 1 / 400
start fox     1 / 5000
start flower  1 / 250
start hive    1 / 20000
start grass   1 / 20
start seed    1 / 100
